Also contains the event-discussion paste fix (components/EventMessages.tsx), which this
message does not mention.

The composer was an <input type="text">, which cannot hold a newline, so a pasted
multi-line message arrived with every paragraph break flattened. It became an
auto-growing <textarea> (Enter sends, Shift+Enter makes a new line). Storage and
rendering were never lossy — the API only trims, and messages render with
whitespace-pre-wrap — so the composer was the single lossy step.

The change was uncommitted in the working tree when this commit was made with
'git add -A' from a parallel session, so it was swept in here. The matching fix for
the hangout discussion is 5f1df44, and the too-long-message handling is fd5d8db.
